Similarly for origin/destination availabilities we need operator linked for lock actions. We have only one operator; we can assign to origin_availability, lock, then release, then assign to destination_availability, lock, release.

Now we need to manage vehicle units: we have three vehicles. We'll need to allocate vehicles to each candidate before dispatch, and after dispatch they become available again.

