14. activate_destination_node destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
15. lock_destination_availability destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha driver_operator_alpha
   (Now destination locked and confirmed)

Now we have both origin and destination locked and confirmed.

Now assemble transport leg:

16. assemble_transport_leg origin_availability_alpha destination_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha destination_node_alpha transport_leg_alpha
   Preconditions: origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available.
   We have origin_node_ready from step6, destination_node_ready from step14, transport_leg_available initially true. Good.

