After this, dispatch_allocated origin_availability_alpha true, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked origin_availability_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha, dispatch_slot_available false.

21. execute_origin_dispatch origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha
